OL,3,GNEWSA'Increasing concern' for missing
OL,4,A20-year-old woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say they are growing
OL,7,Fincreasingly concerned for the welfare
OL,8,Fof a 20-year-old woman missing in
OL,9,FDumfries and Galloway.
OL,11,FKelsey Hunter was last seen in the
OL,12,FCotton Street area of Castle Douglas at
OL,13,Fabout 17:00 on Saturday.
OL,15,FThere has been a large police presence
OL,16,Fat her home in Reoch Park, Springholm,
OL,17,Fwhere officers in white forensic suits
OL,18,Fwere seen entering the property.
